    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hit tabletop card game <i>Potion Slingers</i> has gone digital and is coming to Steam soon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Potion Slingers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete to be the last one standing in a spectator packed marketplace arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strap on your holster and buy all sorts of potions, vessels, artifacts, and rings from the market to dispatch your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan your turns carefully and combine cards to use their bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge the wasteland of junk and survive to be the ultimate Potion Slinger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064190/extras/d64526cb72d0df3ba52da27219fb6b3f.poster.avif?t=1742231350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064190/extras/d64526cb72d0df3ba52da27219fb6b3f.webm?t=1742231350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064190/extras/d64526cb72d0df3ba52da27219fb6b3f.mp4?t=1742231350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast magical junkyard of Manano with 9 different characters, battle all sorts of alchemic baddies, and scour the market for rare and powerful items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120+ cards to discover and laugh at!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player story mode with routes for 9 characters with unique abilities! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer lobbies and PvP combat between friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hit tabletop card game <i>Potion Slingers</i> has gone digital and is coming to Steam soon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Potion Slingers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete to be the last one standing in a spectator packed marketplace arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strap on your holster and buy all sorts of potions, vessels, artifacts, and rings from the market to dispatch your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan your turns carefully and combine cards to use their bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge the wasteland of junk and survive to be the ultimate Potion Slinger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064190/extras/d64526cb72d0df3ba52da27219fb6b3f.poster.avif?t=1742231350\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064190/extras/d64526cb72d0df3ba52da27219fb6b3f.webm?t=1742231350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064190/extras/d64526cb72d0df3ba52da27219fb6b3f.mp4?t=1742231350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast magical junkyard of Manano with 9 different characters, battle all sorts of alchemic baddies, and scour the market for rare and powerful items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120+ cards to discover and laugh at!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single player story mode with routes for 9 characters with unique abilities! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer lobbies and PvP combat between friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
